{"etape": 16, "horodatage_utc": "2026-10-27T13:50:32.444767Z", "outil": "transfer_to_human_agents", "arguments": {"summary": "Ethan Martin (user ID: ethan_martin_2396, silver member) is complaining about a delayed flight HAT039 (ATL → SEA, 2024-05-15) on reservation M61CQM. The reservation has 3 passengers (Ethan Martin, Mia Thomas, Liam Johnson), economy cabin, no travel insurance, paid $1,059 on credit card ending 8023. The user does NOT want to change or cancel the reservation, but is requesting compensation (voucher or refund) for the significant delay and wants to know the reason for the delay. Per policy, compensation for a delayed flight is only offered when the customer proceeds with a change or cancellation, so this request is outside my scope. Customer explicitly requested a human agent."}, "resultat": "Transfer successful", "erreur": null}
